msgid "Voting in this cycle"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:162
msgid "Who can vote?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:163
msgid ""
"All residents of the city of Boston who are 11 years or older are eligible "
"to participate."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:164
msgid "How do I submit my vote?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:165
msgid ""
"You can submit your vote online through our secure voting platform. <a "
"href=\"/vote/auth\" data-internal=\"true\">Click here to vote</a>."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:166
msgid "Can I change my vote after submitting it?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:167
msgid ""
"No, once your vote is submitted, it cannot be changed. Please review your "
"choices carefully before finalizing your vote."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:168
msgid "When will the results be announced?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:169
msgid ""
"The results will be announced in late February on the Office of "
"Participatory Budgeting's website, newsletter, and the City's social media "
"accounts."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:170
msgid "Is my vote public?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:171
msgid ""
"No, all votes are confidential and will not be disclosed to the public. Your "
"privacy is protected throughout the voting process."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:172
msgid "How many ideas can I vote for?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:173
msgid ""
"You can vote for up to 5 project ideas. All votes must be submitted at the "
"same time."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:174
msgid "Can I vote more than once?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:175
msgid ""
"No, each resident can submit just one ballot. After submitting, you will not "
"be able to vote again this cycle."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:176
msgid "How long is voting open for?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:177
msgid ""
"The voting phase starts January 15, 2027, and runs through February 15, 2027."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:178
msgid "About Ideas in Action (IIA)"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:179
msgid "What is Ideas in Action?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:180
msgid ""
"Ideas in Action is the City of Boston's Participatory Budgeting initiative, "
"which allows Boston residents to propose and vote on projects to benefit "
"their communities."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:181
msgid "How are projects selected for the ballot?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:182
msgid ""
"Proposals are constructed through community engagement forums that turn <a "
"href=\"https://participate.boston.gov/page/about\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ideas submitted</a> by your neighbors into "
"projects."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:183
msgid "What is participatory budgeting?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:184
msgid ""
"Participatory budgeting is a democratic process in which community members "
"directly decide how to allocate a portion of the public budget for local "
"projects and initiatives. In Boston, residents decide where $2 million of "
"Boston's budget goes, so multiple projects will be funded."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:185
msgid "How can I get involved beyond voting?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:186
msgid ""
"Stay tuned for an announcement of winning projects in the spring. We will "
"reopen for 2027-28 year idea proposals in the summer of 2027. Check out <a "
"href=\"https://boston.gov/participate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">boston.gov/Participate</a> for updated ways on how to stay "
"engaged."
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:187
msgid "What projects have been selected in previous years?"
msgstr ""

#: src/flavors/cycle3/_config.translations.py:188
msgid ""
"Check out projects funded in previous cycles here: <a href=\"https://"
"boston.gov/departments/participatory-budgeting/ideas-action-project-"
"implementation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">boston.gov/"
"departments/participatory-budgeting/ideas-action-project-implementation</a>."
msgstr ""

